# Tool-agnostic ignore file, read by search/indexing tools (ripgrep and everything
# built on it: VS Code search, agent code search). Git does NOT read this file --
# anything that matters for version control belongs in .gitignore.
# Only hide paths that ARE tracked but are pointless to search.
#
# Deliberately absent: .github and the hand-written .vscode/*.json files. Those are
# committed on purpose and should stay discoverable by search.

/.git
/.vs
/Content
/DerivedDataCache
/Intermediate
/Saved
/Tools
/Plugins/CommonTools/Intermediate
/Plugins/ElectronicNodes/Intermediate
/Plugins/Fluid2DSystem/Content
/Plugins/Fluid2DSystem/Intermediate
/Plugins/WeatherSystem/Content
/Plugins/WeatherSystem/Intermediate
/Plugins/WindSystem/Content
/Plugins/WindSystem/Intermediate

# UBT-generated IntelliSense data: thousands of .rsp response files plus large JSON
# databases. Regenerated on demand and never worth searching.
/.vscode/compileCommands_Default
/.vscode/compileCommands_Wind
/.vscode/compileCommands_*.json
/.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
